<div class="section-content">
      <div class="region region--content-prefix clearfix" id="page-content-prefix">
          <div data-drupal-messages-fallback class="hidden"></div>

      </div>

  <div class="layout-container">
    <main id="main" class="column">
    <a id="main-content" tabindex="-1"></a>    <div class="layout-content">
            <div class="region region--content clearfix" id="content">
    <div id="block-de-theme-content" class="block block-system block-system-main-block">
  
    
      
<article class="node node--type-basic-page-new node--view-mode-full">

  
    

  
  <div class="node__content">
    
            <div class="field field--name-field-image field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item">  <img loading="lazy" src="/sites/default/files/styles/banner_large_short_x2/public/2026-08/sunymc-fall-baseball26-hero.jpg?h=a612ed85&amp;itok=ivmmKBQN" width="2880" height="900" alt="2026 Fall Baseball Prospect Camp" class="image-style-banner-large-short-x2" />


</div>
      
      <div class="field field--name-field-basic-page-components field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden field__items">
              <div class="field__item">  <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--basic-text paragraph--view-mode--default">
          
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-basic-text-body field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><h1><span class="special-title-red">2026 Fall Baseball Prospect Camp</span></h1><h2><span class="special-title">Sunday, September 27th 2026</span></h2><h3><span class="headline-grey">Reinhart Baseball Field | 9:00am - 3:00pm</span></h3><h4><span class="headline-grey">Cost: $95.00</span></h4></div>
      
      </div>
</div>
              <div class="field__item">  <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--basic-text paragraph--view-mode--default">
          
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-basic-text-body field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p>This camp offers student-athletes with a desire to play baseball at the collegiate level an opportunity to be instructed by and play in front of the Maritime College coaching staff. The camp will consist of a college skills workout, complete with batting practice, defensive position evaluation, arm strength evaluation, and 60-yard dash times. Detailed positional instruction will take place following the skills workout. The last part of the clinic will consist of a 7-inning game to show your ability through competition.</p><h4><span class="special-title">Players Receive:</span></h4><ul><li>Professional instruction by the Privateer Baseball Coaching Staff</li><li>Opportunity to be evaluated by the Privateer Baseball Coaching Staff</li><li>Live games to highlight the player's ability through competition</li><li>Campus Tour at the conclusion of the camp</li></ul><h4><span class="special-title">Important:</span></h4><p>Our High School Prospect Clinics are filled by position. Registration will be closed once a position has been filled. Infielders will play 2B, 3B, and SS in the games. First Basemen will only play 1st in the games. Outfielders will play CF, LF, and RF in the games. Pitchers will throw 2 innings during the games. Please place your primary position in the registration.</p></div>
      
      </div>
</div>
              <div class="field__item">  <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--basic-text paragraph--view-mode--default">
          
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-basic-text-body field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><section class="split-section"><!-- Left column --><div class="privateer"><!-- Image Block --><div class="image-block"><p><img alt="Reinhart Field" src="https://www.sunymaritime.edu/sites/default/files/2026-08/sunymc-baseball-reihardt.jpg"></p></div><!-- Image Block --></div><!-- Right column --><div class="privateer"><h4>Itinerary:</h4><p>8:45am: Arrival<br>9:00am: Intro and Stretch<br>9:20am: 60-yard dash<br>9:50am: Defensive Clinic<br>10:15am: Defensive Showcase<br>11:00am: Batting Practice<br>12:00pm: Lunch Break<br>1:00pm: Game<br>3:00pm: Campus Tour</p><h4>Items to bring:</h4><p>Baseball uniform<br>Baseball bat and batting gloves<br>Baseball glove<br>Helmet if you have one (Helmets will be provided)<br>Baseball hat<br>Catcher's gear (only for those signed up to catch)<br>Cleats<br>Lunch<br>&nbsp;</p></div></section><style type="text/css">
    *, *::before, *::after {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    body {
      font-family: "Barlow", sans-serif;
      font-size: 15px;
      color: #333;
      background: #fff;
    }
	
	/* ── Image Block ── */
	.image-block {
    margin: 40px 0;
  }
  .image-block img {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 550px;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }
  .caption {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #666;
    margin-top: 10px;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }
    /* ── Two-column section ── */
    .split-section {
      display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: flex-start;
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 60px 40px;
      gap: 60px;
    }
    .split-section .privateer {
      flex: 1 1 500px;
      min-width: 0;
    }
    /* Vertical divider between columns */
    .split-section .privateer:first-child {
      padding-right: 40px;
      border-right: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
    }
    /* ── Typography ── */
    .privateer h2 {
      font-size: 1.65rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #1a3664;        /* ForgeRock navy */
      line-height: 1.25;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }
    .privateer p {
      color: #444;
      line-height: 1.65;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    /* ── Bullet lists ── */
    .privateer ul {
      list-style: none;
      margin: 16px 0 24px 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    .privateer ul li {
      position: relative;
      padding-left: 18px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      line-height: 1.55;
      color: #333;
    }
    .privateer ul li::before {
      content: "▪";
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      color: #1a3664;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      top: 3px;
    }
    /* ── Inline links ── */
    .privateer ul li a,
    .privateer p a {
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: underline;
      text-decoration-color: #1a3664;
      text-underline-offset: 2px;
    }
    /* ── Bold inline text ── */
    .privateer ul li strong {
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    /* ── Tablet: narrow the gap, smaller padding ── */
    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .split-section {
        padding: 48px 28px;
        gap: 32px;
      }
      .split-section .privateer:first-child {
        padding-right: 24px;
      }
      .privateer h2 {
        font-size: 1.35rem;
      }
    }
    /* ── Mobile: single-column stack ── */
    @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .split-section {
        display: block; /* more reliable than flex-direction on some mobile browsers */
        padding: 32px 20px;
    }
    .split-section .privateer {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 100%;
        display: block;
    }
    .split-section .privateer:first-child {
        padding-right: 0;
        border-right: none;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
        padding-bottom: 32px;
        margin-bottom: 32px;
    }
    .privateer h2 {
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .privateer p,
    .privateer li {
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
    }
	}
		
	/* ── Mobile: spacing tweaks for Image Block ── */
  @media (max-width: 550px) {
    .image-block {
      margin: 30px 0;
    }
    }
  </style></div>
      
      </div>
</div>
              <div class="field__item">  <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--basic-text paragraph--view-mode--default">
          
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-basic-text-body field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><h4><span class="headline-grey">Note</span></h4><p>Maritime College or our baseball program is NOT responsible for lost or stolen equipment.</p><h4><span class="headline-grey">Camp Check-in</span></h4><p>Please arrive at least 15 minutes prior to the start time.</p><h4><span class="headline-grey">Address</span></h4><p>6 Pennyfield Avenue<br>Throggs Neck, NY 10465</p><p>Park in Lot 5 for easiest access to the field.</p><h4><span class="headline-grey">Accommodations</span></h4><p>This is not an "overnight" camp. Players traveling from out of town will be responsible for securing their own accommodations.</p><h4><span class="headline-grey">Inclement Weather</span></h4><p>If the scheduled day is postponed due to inclement weather, the make-up date will be <strong>Sunday, October 4th, 2026</strong>. However, we will do everything possible to complete the camp on its scheduled date. Full refunds will be available if you cannot attend the make-up date.</p><h4><span class="headline-grey">Athletic Training Staff</span></h4><p>There will be a trainer on duty at all times.</p><h4><span class="headline-grey">Waiver Form</span></h4><p>Student-athletes attending the camp will be required to complete a waiver before participating.</p><p><a class="btn-primary" href="/sites/default/files/2026-08/maritime-athletics-liability-waiver.pdf" target="_blank">Download Waiver</a></p><h4><span class="headline-grey">Contact Information</span></h4><p>For general questions or for more information, please contact head coach Charlie Barbieri at <a href="mailto:cbarbieri@sunymaritime.edu">cbarbieri@sunymaritime.edu</a>.</p></div>
      
      </div>
</div>
              <div class="field__item">  <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--basic-text paragraph--view-mode--default">
          
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-basic-text-body field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><!-- Start form embed --><script src="https://sky.blackbaudcdn.net/static/reg-form-loader/5/main.js"></script><!--
